{
    "theme": "akuwm",
    // AkuWM's focused-window colour, painted by the Terminal itself: it resets
    // DWMWA_BORDER_COLOR on every activation, so a colour set from outside
    // never survives (measured 2026-09-22). unfocusedFrame "default" keeps the
    // usual grey when another window has the focus.
    "themes": [
        {
            "name": "akuwm",
            "window": { "applicationTheme": "dark", "frame": "#C4A7E7", "unfocusedFrame": "default" }
        }
    ],
  "_comment": "Merge into %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Packages\\Microsoft.WindowsTerminal_8wekyb3d8bbwe\\LocalState\\settings.json — NixOS-WSL registers the 'NixOS' profile itself; the default profile is 'NixOS ~/.dotfiles' = wsl-or-pwsh.ps1 (NixOS at ~/.dotfiles, PowerShell fallback when WSL cannot start). Look = DESK.",
